WEBVTT

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:06.770
Availability cover and concerns 9 Availability and cover Daniel's fictional

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:11.930
normal support period is 08:00 to 17:00 This is a

00:00:11.930 --> 00:00:17.490
case fact not an employment recommendation Any planned work outside

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:22.330
that period requires an agreed arrangement Aisha is the appointed

00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:28.160
deputy for accepted cover periods using her own authorised access

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:31.755
The control room's monitoring coverage is separately defined and does

00:00:31.755 --> 00:00:36.270
not depend on Daniel personally watching a phone after work

00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:39.450
Neither the existence of Aisha nor the word deputy means

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:44.105
that she has accepted every future assignment 10 Concerns and

00:00:44.105 --> 00:00:49.480
unresolved decisions Routine priority conflicts go to Lindiwe or the

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:56.560
designated substitute decision-maker Concerns involving personal safety improper conduct or

00:00:56.560 --> 00:01:01.225
the executive herself have an alternative organisational reporting route identified

00:01:01.225 --> 00:01:07.140
in the controlled contact register Daniel reports missing authority information

00:01:07.140 --> 00:01:11.850
or service acceptance with the consequence and the decision required

00:01:11.850 --> 00:01:15.285
Essential emergency help is not delayed to complete a routine

00:01:15.285 --> 00:01:22.235
administrative approval chain 11 Handover and continuing activity A handover

00:01:22.235 --> 00:01:29.350
identifies the current plan open decisions commitments information location relevant

00:01:29.350 --> 00:01:34.110
service acceptance and the named incoming owner That person confirms

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:39.165
acceptance The outgoing and incoming roles are recorded separately from

00:01:39.165 --> 00:01:44.855
the control room's ongoing responsibilities If cover is not accepted

00:01:44.855 --> 00:01:48.805
Daniel escalates to the duty manager or designated owner the

00:01:48.805 --> 00:01:53.040
unresolved obligation is not silently closed or indefinitely assigned to

00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:54.845
him by default
